1
00:00:00,383 --> 00:00:36,511
Covex homepage. System uses off-white background, dark headline (hex C33A36 only for accent later), Bdogrotesk-like headings at 48 pixel weight 500, Interdisplay body at 16 pixel 400, and large 24 pixel rounded cards. Top bar sticks, logo left, main CTA is a 44 pixel tall dark pill. Hero uses GSAP + SplitText reveal and a sticky CSS header.

2
00:00:56,011 --> 00:01:14,662
Headline left uses 36 pixel weight 500, image card right 420 pixels high with 24 pixel radius, and a wide 80 pixel gutter separates them. Keep body copy at 16 pixel Interdisplay.

3
00:03:37,787 --> 00:03:59,704
Team section shows a horizontal carousel of cards about 300 pixels wide and 420 pixels tall. Portrait area is roughly 300 by 300 with 24 pixel corners. Carousel arrows are circular 44 pixel diameter buttons at top-right. Team carousel uses GSAP for animated horizontal scroll.

4
00:06:04,579 --> 00:06:46,453
Design system: warm gradient accents, off-white backgrounds, Bdogrotesk-like display headings and Interdisplay body, big 24 pixel radii and pill CTAs, and GSAP-driven reveal animations are the strongest decisions — they create a clear rhythm and motion. The weakest decision is repeating the same giant red CTA many times; it dilutes urgency and could be tuned to vary content or intent. It is a Webflow site using GSAP with ScrollTrigger, SplitText, Lottie and jQuery for animations and interactions.
